Write a program to find the largest number in an array

SOLUTION:

import java.util.*;
class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc=new Scanner(System.in);
        int n=sc.nextInt();
        ArrayList<Integer> a=new ArrayList<>();
        for(int i=0;i<n;i++)
        {
            a.add(sc.nextInt());
            Collections.sort(a);
        }
        System.out.print(a.get(n-1));
    }
}
